**DIRAC
.TITLE
 CH (X 2Pi)
.WAVE FUNCTION
.PROPERTIES
#.ANALYZE
#.4INDEX
**GENERAL
! Direct evaluation of two-electron integrals
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*TWOINT
#.SOFOCK
**HAMILTONIAN
#.BSS
#2999
.PRINT
2
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.DHF
#.RELCCSD
#.MP2
*DHFCAL ! DHF specifications...
.CLOSED SHELL
6  
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0E-9  1.0D-7
###########################################################
#
# Set up properties
#
############################################################
**PROPERTIES ! Calculating of properties...
.PRINT
2
.DIPOLE
*EXPECTATION VALUE
.PRINT
2
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
1..14
.NETPOP
**MOLTRA
# ... take all orbitals ...
.ACTIVE
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
*END OF

 &RELCCSD DOFSPC=T DOENER=F IPRNT=2 &END
 &CCSORT  USEOE=F &END
 &CCFSPC MAXIT=200, NACTH=3,3 NACTP=4,4 FSSECT=1,1,1,1,0,0 &END

